inst/proto/spark-connect.binpb
------------------------------

A serialised protocol buffer descriptor set built by
tools/build-descriptors.sh from two sources, pinned in inst/proto/VERSION.

1. The Spark Connect protocol definitions of Apache Spark, at the tag in
   VERSION: sql/connect/common/src/main/protobuf/spark/connect/*.proto
   (base, catalog, commands, common, example_plugins, expressions, ml,
   ml_common, pipelines, relations, types).

   Copyright 2014 and onwards The Apache Software Foundation. Apache
   Spark's NOTICE file is reproduced in inst/proto/NOTICE.

2. google/rpc/status.proto and google/rpc/error_details.proto of
   https://github.com/googleapis/googleapis, at the commit in VERSION.

